<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the quarter-finals of</p>
<p>the French soccer Cup on Saturday:</p>
<p> Bordeaux   1   Montpellier 2</p>
<p> Creteil    1   Guingamp    3</p>
<p> Laval	1   Troyes	0</p>
<p>Playing Sunday: Clermont v Nice.</p>
</text>
